{'symbol': 'STX', 'date': '2022-02-27 22:30:00', 'title': 'SEAGATE EXPANDS LYVE CLOUD STORAGE SERVICES TO SINGAPORE', 'text': "FREMONT, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY HOLDINGS PLC (NASDAQ: STX), A WORLD LEADER IN DATA STORAGE INFRASTRUCTURE SOLUTIONS, LAUNCHED ITS PREMIERE CLOUD STORAGE-AS-A-SERVICE PLATFORM, LYVE™ CLOUD, FOR BUSINESSES OF ALL SIZES IN SINGAPORE. THE S3-COMPATIBLE STORAGE-ONLY CLOUD KNOWN FOR ITS SIMPLICITY, FLEXIBILITY AND COST PREDICTABILITY HAS BEEN TRUSTED BY MANY PARTNERS AND CUSTOMERS SINCE ITS LAUNCH IN THE UNITED STATES LAST YEAR. “THE SINGAPORE LAUNCH MARKS LYVE CLOUD'S ANNIVERSAR"}